From 346c1a0d9d85b9e1c7473294310b277a556109a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:19:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): route creator scratch cleanup to the home
 gateway [daveey]

Use a scoped creator_archive action over the authenticated operator courier; recheck creator and claim scope inside the home archive transaction. General foreign archive remains refused. Detection option (b): retire scratch triage cards with a finished creator and an explicit archive command in the latest comment, preserving human, claim and dependency exclusions.

Proof: two-gateway regressions fail on the base with ForeignCardError; detection regressions fail by re-readying the fixture. Focused regressions and operator/relay/triage consumers pass. Additional full gates and exact-head review required before landing.
